%% WebSocket chat fan-out and offline notification.
sequenceDiagram
actor Sender
participant WebApp
participant Gateway
participant Chat
participant Presence
participant Recipient
participant Push
Sender->>WebApp: Send message
WebApp->>Gateway: WebSocket frame
activate Gateway
Gateway->>Chat: Persist and publish
activate Chat
Chat->>Presence: Find members
Presence-->>Chat: Recipients
loop [each recipient]
Chat->>Recipient: Deliver
Recipient-->>Chat: Acknowledge
end
opt [offline]
Chat->>Push: Push notification
Push-->>Chat: Accepted
end
Chat-->>Gateway: Accepted
deactivate Chat
Gateway-->>WebApp: Receipt
deactivate Gateway
WebApp-->>Sender: Sent
Note over Gateway,Chat: Persist before receipt
